{"seq":2,"slug":"techniques","title":"核心技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hash-ring","title":"哈希环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/techniques/hash-ring","wordCount":1589,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"virtual-nodes","title":"虚拟节点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/techniques/virtual-nodes","wordCount":1512,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"rendezvous-hashing","title":"Rendezvous 哈希","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/techniques/rendezvous-hashing","wordCount":1586,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"核心技术\">核心技术</h1><p>一致性哈希不是单一算法，而是一族解决同一问题的思路。这一章把三种最核心、最值得先掌握的方案讲透，它们共同构成后面进阶与工程实践的基石。</p>\n<p>哈希环是教科书式的经典做法，也是最广泛部署的。节点和键被同一个哈希函数映射到一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, 2^{32})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的环上，键顺时针归属于遇到的第一个节点。它的妙处在于：增删一个节点，只搅动环上相邻的一段弧，其余键纹丝不动。这一篇会把查找、插入、删除的实现细节和复杂度讲清楚。</p>\n<p>虚拟节点是对哈希环一个几乎必备的补丁。裸环上节点稀疏，弧长高低不均，负载倾斜严重；让一台物理机在环上占据上百个虚拟点，就能把方差压下来。这一篇会给出虚拟节点数量与负载方差之间的定量关系。</p>\n<p>Rendezvous 哈希（最高随机权重 HRW）走的是完全不同的路：不维护环，对每个候选节点计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">hash(key, node)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ey</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，取分数最高者。它实现极简、天然支持加权、节点列表无需有序，代价是查找复杂度随节点数线性增长。</p>\n<p>这三者并非互相替代，而是各有适用场景：环适合大规模、需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 查找；Rendezvous 适合中小规模、看重简洁与加权。读完本章你应能在两者之间做出有依据的选择，再进入进阶章去看它们各自的改良。</p>\n"}